Modifications from upstream are described in ../../README.md and cover the build
pipeline (gulp 5, esbuild, svgo, TypeScript sources) and the upgrade from
highlight.js 9 to 11. The Handlebars templates and stylesheets remain
substantially upstream's work.

The syntax-highlighting palette is highlight.js's own bundled themes, "GitHub
Dark" and "GitHub Dark Dimmed" (highlight.js/styles/github-dark(-dimmed).css),
imported as-is from the highlight.js package already listed as a dependency
below and scoped to this bundle's two site themes by
gulp.d/lib/hljs-theme-scope.js at build time — see src/css/site.css's own
comment. Covered by the same BSD-3-Clause licence as highlight.js itself:

